# Web Next Tailwind

**Enforced constraints:**

- MUST prefer Server Components (default in App Router)
- MUST mark Client Components with `'use client'` directive
- MUST use `next/link` for internal navigation (not `<a>`)
- MUST use `next/image` for images (not `<img>`)
- MUST use `next/font` for web fonts
- MUST follow App Router file conventions (page.tsx, layout.tsx, loading.tsx, error.tsx)
- MUST implement metadata for SEO (static or dynamic)
- MUST follow Tailwind component/utility architecture from react-tailwind module

See `instructions.md` for Server vs Client Component patterns, data fetching, metadata, and optimization examples.
